{'symbol': 'ISRG', 'date': '2021-08-31 16:25:00', 'title': 'INTUITIVE APPOINTS NEW GENERAL MANAGER IN SOUTH KOREA', 'text': 'SUNNYVALE, CALIF., AUG. 31, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- INTUITIVE (NASDAQ: ISRG), A GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY LEADER IN MINIMALLY INVASIVE CARE AND THE PIONEER OF ROBOTIC-ASSISTED SURGERY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF YONG-BUM CHOI AS GENERAL MANAGER FOR SOUTH KOREA, WHERE HE WILL DIRECT BUSINESS STRATEGY AND OPERATIONS FOR THE COMPANY.'}